        <briefdescription>
<para>Rewrites <computeroutput>S</computeroutput> in the context of a loop L and the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_s_c_e_v" kindref="compound">SCEV</ref> predication infrastructure. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>If <computeroutput>Pred</computeroutput> is non-null, the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_s_c_e_v" kindref="compound">SCEV</ref> expression is rewritten to respect the equivalences present in <computeroutput>Pred</computeroutput>.</para>
<para>If <computeroutput>NewPreds</computeroutput> is non-null, rewrite is free to add further predicates to <computeroutput>NewPreds</computeroutput> such that the result will be an AddRecExpr. </para>
